{"strongs": "H2236", "word": "זָרַק", "translit": "za.raq", "root": "זרע", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "to toss or throw", "definition": "זָרַק verb to toss or throw (in a volume), scatter abundantly (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic זְרַק id. , disperse ; Assyrian zarâ‡u Lotz TP138 Jäger BAS ii. 292 Anm. **; compare also Arabic cast at, pierce , and javelin = Ethiopic ) — Qal Perfect ׳ ז Exod 24:6 ; Lev 17:6 , suffix זְרָקוֺ Exod 9:8 , זָָֽרְקָה Hos 7:9 (12 t. Perfect); Imperfect יִזְרֹק Lev 7:2 + 16 t.; Infinitive לִזְרֹק Ezek 43:18 Imperative זְרֹק Ezek 10:2 Participle זֹרֵק Lev 7:14 , plural זֹרְקִים 2Chr 30:16 1. toss (in handfuls, see Exod 9:8 or from a bowl , מִזְרָק ; opposed to הִזָּה to sprinkle with the finger): \\ \\ a. cummin Isa 28:25 , dust, followed by עַל 2Chr 34:4 ; Job 2:12 , ashes השׁמימה , heavenward, Exod 9:8 ; Exod 9:10 ( P ), coals of fire על העיר Ezek 10:2 . \\ \\ b. blood, על (ה)מזבה throw (from a bowl) against the altar Exod 24:6 ( J E ), Lev 17:6 ( H ), Num 18:17 ( P ), 2Kgs 16:13 ; 2Kgs 16:15 ; Ezek 43:18 , especially in the ritual, על חמזבח סביב against the altar round about Exod 29:16 ; Exod 29:20 ; Lev 1:5 ; Lev 1:11 ; Lev 3:2 ; Lev 3:8 ; Lev 3:13 ; Lev 7:2 ; Lev 8:19 ; Lev 8:24 ; Lev 9:12 ; Lev 9:18 (all P ); followed by על העם Exod 24:8 ( J E ), followed by המזבחה 2Chr 29:22 (3 t. in verse); without designation of place Lev 7:14 ( P ), 2Chr 30:16 ; 2Chr 35:11 . \\ \\ c. water for purification, followed by על , Ezek 36:25 . 2. intransitive (si vera lectio) Hos 7:9 גַּם שֵׂיבָה זָָֽרְקָה בּוֺ grey hairs are profuse upon him (? read זָָֽרְחָה , as in 2Chr 26:19 ). Pu`al Perfect זֹרַק , of water of purification poured over ( עַל ) one defiled by a corpse Num 19:18 ; Num 19:20 ( P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2476')\">BDB2476</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2236')\">H2236</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2475')\">BDB2475</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2477')\">BDB2477</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זָרַק</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>to toss or throw</highlightword> (in a volume), scatter abundantly (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>זְרַק</bdbarc> <highlight>id.</highlight>, <placeholder1572/> <highlight>disperse</highlight>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>zarâ‡u</highlight></transliteration> Lotz<sup>TP138</sup> Jäger<sup>BAS ii. 292 Anm.</sup> **; compare also Arabic <placeholder1573/> <highlight>cast at, pierce</highlight>, <placeholder1574/> and <placeholder1575/> <highlight>javelin</highlight> = Ethiopic <placeholder1576/>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 24:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,6)\">Exod 24:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 17:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,17,6)\">Lev 17:6</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>זְרָקוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 9:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,8)\">Exod 9:8</ref>, <bdbheb>זָָֽרְקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,9)\">Hos 7:9</ref> (12 t. Perfect); <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִזְרֹק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 7:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,2)\">Lev 7:2</ref> + 16 t.; <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>לִזְרֹק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,18)\">Ezek 43:18</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>זְרֹק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,2)\">Ezek 10:2</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>זֹרֵק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 7:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,14)\">Lev 7:14</ref>, plural <bdbheb>זֹרְקִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,16)\">2Chr 30:16</ref> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>toss</highlight> (in handfuls, see <ref ref=\"Exod 9:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,8)\">Exod 9:8</ref> or from a <highlight>bowl</highlight>, <bdbheb>מִזְרָק</bdbheb>; opposed to <bdbheb>הִזָּה</bdbheb> to <highlight>sprinkle</highlight> with the finger): <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> cummin <ref ref=\"Isa 28:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,25)\">Isa 28:25</ref>, dust, followed by <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,4)\">2Chr 34:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 2:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,12)\">Job 2:12</ref>, ashes <bdbheb>השׁמימה</bdbheb>, heavenward, <ref ref=\"Exod 9:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,8)\">Exod 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 9:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,10)\">Exod 9:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), coals of fire <bdbheb>על העיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,2)\">Ezek 10:2</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> blood, <bdbheb>על (ה)מזבה</bdbheb> <highlight>throw</highlight> (from a bowl) against the altar <ref ref=\"Exod 24:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,6)\">Exod 24:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lev 17:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,17,6)\">Lev 17:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><refli