>; <ref ref=\"Lev 9:18\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(3,9,18)\">Lev 9:18</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); followed by <bdbheb>על העם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 24:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,8)\">Exod 24:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), followed by <bdbheb>המזבחה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,22)\">2Chr 29:22</ref> (3 t. in verse); without designation of place <ref ref=\"Lev 7:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,14)\">Lev 7:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,16)\">2Chr 30:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,11)\">2Chr 35:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>water</highlight> for purification, followed by <bdbheb>על</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,25)\">Ezek 36:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> intransitive (si vera lectio) <ref ref=\"Hos 7:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,9)\">Hos 7:9</ref> <bdbheb>גַּם שֵׂיבָה זָָֽרְקָה בּוֺ</bdbheb> grey hairs are <highlight>profuse</highlight> upon him (? read <bdbheb>זָָֽרְחָה</bdbheb>, as in <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,19)\">2Chr 26:19</ref>). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>זֹרַק</bdbheb>, of water of purification <highlight>poured</highlight> over (<bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb>) one defiled by a corpse <ref 